{"2468230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cyber Rail", "steam_appid": 2468230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>SPEED IS SURVIVAL</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fine-tuned movement system enables precise and agile maneuvers. With hordes of enemies targeting you from all directions and perilous falls around every corner, a well-timed slide or grapple can mean the difference between life and perma-death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/6d768d68acd467f1bb9243fbe31b4bd3.poster.avif?t=1785786454\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/6d768d68acd467f1bb9243fbe31b4bd3.webm?t=1785786454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/6d768d68acd467f1bb9243fbe31b4bd3.mp4?t=1785786454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>LIGHT 'EM UP</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face down powerful foes using deadly weapons that each have their own special abilities and distinct playstyles. Whether you’re cracking skulls with the revolver or mowing down groups with the SMG, there’s always a new way to lay waste to your robotic adversaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/1800733cddadf675e50201813cb34bfd.poster.avif?t=1785786454\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/1800733cddadf675e50201813cb34bfd.webm?t=1785786454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/1800733cddadf675e50201813cb34bfd.mp4?t=1785786454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>UPGRADE AND ADAPT</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new upgrades and weapons in the saloon, building new strategies and combinations with your hard-earned cash. Fine-tune your kit to suit your playstyle or experiment with a new arsenal for a fresh run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/cf154b766f0923c3ef798b6673c24158.poster.avif?t=1785786454\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/cf154b766f0923c3ef798b6673c24158.webm?t=1785786454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/cf154b766f0923c3ef798b6673c24158.mp4?t=1785786454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>SPEED IS SURVIVAL</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fine-tuned movement system enables precise and agile maneuvers. With hordes of enemies targeting you from all directions and perilous falls around every corner, a well-timed slide or grapple can mean the difference between life and perma-death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/6d768d68acd467f1bb9243fbe31b4bd3.poster.avif?t=1785786454\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/6d768d68acd467f1bb9243fbe31b4bd3.webm?t=1785786454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/6d768d68acd467f1bb9243fbe31b4bd3.mp4?t=1785786454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>LIGHT 'EM UP</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face down powerful foes using deadly weapons that each have their own special abilities and distinct playstyles. Whether you’re cracking skulls with the revolver or mowing down groups with the SMG, there’s always a new way to lay waste to your robotic adversaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/1800733cddadf675e50201813cb34bfd.poster.avif?t=1785786454\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/1800733cddadf675e50201813cb34bfd.webm?t=1785786454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468230/extras/1800733cddadf675e50201813cb34bfd.mp4?t=1785786454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>UPGRADE AND ADAPT</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new upgrades and weapons in the saloon, building new strategies and combinations with your hard-earned cash. Fine-tune your kit to suit your playstyle or experiment with a new arsenal for a fresh run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_parag